&lt;h2&gt;


What DoAide Invoicer is
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;DoAide Invoicer is a free GST invoice generator for Indian businesses. Create professional GST-compliant invoices with auto-numbering, client management, and PDF export.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


How it is built
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Built with FastAPI, React, Vite, PostgreSQL.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


